  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "What mirrors",
      "items": [
        "Every visible chat of an enabled bot from CLI, TUI, Desktop and Conduit, plus its Bot Chat, appears in bb by itself and keeps updating. No \"Continue in bb\" step (D42).",
        "Each bot's Bot Chat goes to that bot's pinned bb thread, not a new one (D44).",
        "CLI, TUI and Desktop run their turns in the gateway, so they stream live in bb. Conduit's own turns arrive in two steps: your message, then the reply."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Import",
      "items": [
        "Runs at every switch-on: that bot's chats active in the last 30 days with no bb thread yet, oldest first. The switch row shows the count first.",
        "Silent: no unread, no push. Older turns of a long chat stay in Hermes, with a note at the top of the thread."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "What stays out",
      "items": [
        "An allow-list that fails closed: cron, one-shot, ACP, API server, a2a, tool, subagent, hidden and empty sessions stay in Hermes, and chats of bots that are switched off.",
        "Discord, Telegram, Slack and other chat apps, DMs included (D49)."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Notifications",
      "items": [
        "Outside activity marks the thread unread. Approvals and clarify questions send a push."
      ]
    }
  ]
